1
00:00:00,650 --> 00:00:02,647
Know the business you invest in.

2
00:00:02,647 --> 00:00:16,164
BlockID Business Passport gives every shareholder, large or small, a live view of the business they own: updates and valuations analysed by AI and approved by people, a share register on blockchain as proof of ownership, and dividends paid straight to their wallet.

3
00:00:17,226 --> 00:00:18,569
It's live today.

4
00:00:18,569 --> 00:00:19,983
Press Try it now.

5
00:00:19,983 --> 00:00:22,004
No sign-up, no wallet.

6
00:00:22,004 --> 00:00:25,438
You start as a demo investor, with real sample data.

7
00:00:26,482 --> 00:00:27,965
Why does this matter?

8
00:00:27,965 --> 00:00:30,559
Investing in a business is hard to follow.

9
00:00:30,559 --> 00:00:32,545
The numbers are hard to trust.

10
00:00:32,545 --> 00:00:36,914
After you invest, you lose sight of sales, profit and new shares.

11
00:00:36,914 --> 00:00:41,084
Ownership sits in a spreadsheet, so your stake can shrink and nobody tells you.

12
00:00:41,084 --> 00:00:43,830
And dividends are slow, or never arrive.

13
00:00:43,830 --> 00:00:48,105
Good businesses struggle to raise money, and problems surface too late to fix.

14
00:00:49,154 --> 00:00:51,560
So we built one passport per business.

15
00:00:51,560 --> 00:00:57,004
Every investor can understand it, follow it, own it, get paid, and check it for themselves.

16
00:00:58,050 --> 00:00:59,206
Understand it.

17
00:00:59,206 --> 00:01:05,795
Paste a website and get a plain report in minutes: a business score from A to E, and a low, mid and high value.

18
00:01:05,795 --> 00:01:07,769
Every figure links to its source.

19
00:01:07,769 --> 00:01:09,720
No source, no number.

20
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,571
And a person approves it before anyone sees it.

21
00:01:13,618 --> 00:01:19,096
Behind the report, AI agents read the website, find competitors and analyse the market.

22
00:01:19,096 --> 00:01:22,473
A finding that cites a page the agent never fetched is dropped.

23
00:01:22,473 --> 00:01:24,389
The agents hold no keys.

24
00:01:24,389 --> 00:01:26,141
They can only propose.

25
00:01:27,194 --> 00:01:28,023
Own it.

26
00:01:28,023 --> 00:01:34,472
Every holder, wallet and share count sits in one share register on blockchain, copied to Ethereum and HashKey Chain.

27
00:01:34,472 --> 00:01:38,864
New shares need a person's approval, and investors see the dilution first.

28
00:01:39,930 --> 00:01:42,301
This is Airwallex on our test network.

29
00:01:42,301 --> 00:01:46,822
Fifteen verified holders, read straight from the chain, not from a spreadsheet.

30
00:01:47,890 --> 00:01:49,840
Follow it, and get paid.

31
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:54,373
The business shares its numbers, weekly, monthly, quarterly or yearly.

32
00:01:54,373 --> 00:02:00,682
The draft flags risks from the numbers, a person approves it, and every investor gets the same update at the same time.

33
00:02:00,682 --> 00:02:02,901
A dividend rule is approved once.

34
00:02:02,901 --> 00:02:07,854
After twenty-four hours to cancel, it is paid to every wallet, with no fees for holders.

35
00:02:08,906 --> 00:02:09,805
Check it.

36
00:02:09,805 --> 00:02:11,055
Don't trust us.

37
00:02:11,055 --> 00:02:15,261
Your browser hashes the report and compares it with the record on three blockchains.

38
00:02:15,261 --> 00:02:17,784
Change one number, and it turns red.

39
00:02:18,834 --> 00:02:22,034
Under the hood, only approved actions reach the chain.

40
00:02:22,034 --> 00:02:24,488
AI analysis runs with no keys.

41
00:02:24,488 --> 00:02:26,871
An admin wallet signs one approval.

42
00:02:26,871 --> 00:02:31,252
Only then does the isolated issuer, the only part with a key, act.

43
00:02:31,252 --> 00:02:35,060
Our AgentProvenance contract records who proposed and who approved.

44
00:02:35,060 --> 00:02:36,462
Agents propose.

45
00:02:36,462 --> 00:02:37,744
Humans approve.

46
00:02:37,744 --> 00:02:39,079
Chains prove.

47
00:02:40,114 --> 00:02:43,501
Business Passport is live today, on three blockchains.

48
00:02:43,501 --> 00:02:48,864
Businesses pay a listing fee and a register subscription, plus small transfer and dividend fees.

49
00:02:48,864 --> 00:02:53,373
We're looking for pilot businesses, investor communities and licensed partners.

50
00:02:53,373 --> 00:02:56,387
Try it now, at eth dot blockid dot au.
